ll},{"t":146.75,"len":3.95,"kind":"shot","clip":"BOOTS/ch14_03_chapter_14.mp4","file":"BOOTS/ch14_03_chapter_14.mp4","in":0,"policy":"BOOT","ch":14,"func":"TITLE","status":"interstitial","still":false,"pid":"boot_ch14_03_chapter_14","pan":null,"boot":true},{"t":150.7,"len":5.61,"kind":"shot","clip":"14_vision-pro/Empty_room_digital_interface_win…_202607101944.mp4","file":"assets/14_vision-pro/Empty_room_digital_interface_win…_202607101944.mp4","in":3.39,"policy":"MUTE","ch":14,"func":"human","status":"documented","still":false,"pid":"14_vision_pro_Empty_room_digital_interface_win_202607101944_mp4","pan":null},{"t":156.31,"len":1.72,"kind":"shot","clip":"14_vision-pro/Spatial_interface_demonstration_…_202607101944.mp4","file":"assets/14_vision-pro/Spatial_interface_demonstration_…_202607101944.mp4","in":5.84,"policy":"MUTE","ch":14,"func":"human","status":"documented","still":false,"pid":"14_vision_pro_Spatial_interface_demonstration_202607101944_mp4","pan":null}],"voice":[{"t":4.1,"dur":9,"clip":"01_3d-golden/Lion_leaps_toward_camera_202607101843.mp4","file":"assets/01_3d-golden/Lion_leaps_toward_camera_202607101843.mp4","in":0,"text":"We believed we could impose our own order on the world, but we forgot that some forces can never be contained.","kw":["believed","could","impose","order","world","forgot","some","forces"],"ch":1},{"t":15.51,"dur":4.76,"clip":"02_telesphere/Presenter_demonstrates_cinema_he…_202607101850.mp4","file":"assets/02_telesphere/Presenter_demonstrates_cinema_he…_202607101850.mp4","in":3.12,"text":"Notice the dual eyepieces for individual viewing, a private theater that travels everywhere with you.","kw":["notice","dual","eyepieces","individual","viewing","private","theater","travels"],"ch":2},{"t":26.68,"dur":10,"clip":"03_sensorama/Fans_spinning_in_dark_space_202607101922.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/Fans_spinning_in_dark_space_202607101922.mp4","in":0,"text":"It was a device designed to replace reality by manipulating the very air we breathe.","kw":["device","designed","replace","reality","manipulating","very","breathe"],"ch":3},{"t":37.96,"dur":10,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Early_computer_graphics_wirefram…_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Early_computer_graphics_wirefram…_202607101924.mp4","in":0,"text":"In the 1960s, a small group of engineers began to believe that they could contain the chaos of the world.","kw":["small","group","engineers","began","believe","could","contain","chaos"],"ch":4},{"t":49.78,"dur":5,"clip":"05_damocles/Headset_in_university_lab_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Headset_in_university_lab_202607101926.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"We thought we were looking at a new world, but we were only looking at ourselves.","kw":["thought","looking","world","only","ourselves"],"ch":5},{"t":60.46,"dur":6,"clip":"06_public-grid/AI_presenter_describes_electroni…_202607101856.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/AI_presenter_describes_electroni…_202607101856.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"It must be treated as a true civic utility for everyone.","kw":["must","treated","true","civic","utility","everyone"],"ch":6},{"t":71.83,"dur":9,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Hand_reaching_for_wireframe_object_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Hand_reaching_for_wireframe_object_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, we believed we could create a world of perfect order, but the machines only showed us our own failure.","kw":["believed","could","create","world","perfect","order","machines","only"],"ch":7},{"t":83.12,"dur":7,"clip":"08_vpl/People_wearing_HMDs_DataGloves_202607101938.mp4","file":"assets/08_vpl/People_wearing_HMDs_DataGloves_202607101938.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1987, scientists believed they could create a new world, a shared space beyond physical reality.","kw":["scientists","believed","could","create","world","shared","space","beyond"],"ch":8},{"t":94.92,"dur":7.28,"clip":"09_arcade-era/AI_historical_reconstruction_VHS…_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/AI_historical_reconstruction_VHS…_202607101900.mp4","in":0,"text":"They promised they escaped from reality, but they were trapped in a private world.","kw":["promised","escaped","reality","trapped","private","world"],"ch":9},{"t":105.69,"dur":9,"clip":"10_vr-winter/Hand_marking_liquidation_report_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/Hand_marking_liquidation_report_202607101941.mp4","in":0,"text":"But the vision of a new reality was quickly deleted by the cold, hard logic of the balance sheet.","kw":["vision","reality","quickly","deleted","cold","hard","logic","balance"],"ch":10},{"t":116.98,"dur":9,"clip":"11_oculus/AI-generated_reconstruction_empt…_202607101902.mp4","file":"assets/11_oculus/AI-generated_reconstruction_empt…_202607101902.mp4","in":0,"text":"It was a new kind of collective power, but it would soon lead to a strange form of control.","kw":["kind","collective","power","would","soon","lead","strange","form"],"ch":11},{"t":128.55,"dur":7.68,"clip":"12_consumer-vr/Person_wearing_VR_headset_hits_202607101942.mp4","file":"assets/12_consumer-vr/Person_wearing_VR_headset_hits_202607101942.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was a fantasy where the real world would soon intervene.","kw":["fantasy","where","real","world","would","soon","intervene"],"ch":12},{"t":139.56,"dur":7,"clip":"13_open-standard/Hands_passing_VR_trackers_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Hands_passing_VR_trackers_202607101943.mp4","in":2.88,"text":"A retreat from the giant systems into a world they could build together.","kw":["retreat","giant","systems","world","could","build","together"],"ch":13},{"t":150.85,"dur":8,"clip":"14_vision-pro/Spatial_interface_demonstration_…_202607101944.mp4","file":"assets/14_vision-pro/Spatial_interface_demonstration_…_202607101944.mp4","in":0,"text":"This is the simplified world, where everything is tracked and perfectly connected.","kw":["simplified","world","where","everything","tracked","perfectly","connected"],"ch":14}],"duck":[[0,3